// Dialog :
"P361818738" "Excellent work, {HeroName}! Maestro is now back in the Zig. I almost feel bad for him; the Council promised to return his hearing, only for him to turn into... <i>this</i> after an Arachnos attack.<br><br>The presence of Nictus indicates that <color yellow>Arakhn</color> and her forces are at work.<br><br>Grant will investigate Arakhn; in the meantime, Riptide has sent in an urgent request for help in Croatoa."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3918666147" "Riptide sent us a report that several odd chambers were air dropped into Croatoa. Shortly afterwards, creatures resembling vampires emerged from them! This is no doubt the work of <color yellow>Nosferatu</color>. Riptide is on the scene now trying to hold him off.<br><br>The Council is trying to occupy Croatoa, which is very... strange. It's not a strategic spot at all, but they're sending one of their top lieutenants to take the area.<br><br>Founders' Falls... Croatoa... they don't make any sense as strategic targets, {HeroName}. Why not attack Atlas Park, Kings Row, or Independence Port? They're all more valuable than these places..."
// AcceptString :
"P1675639549" "I'll head to Croatoa to deal with Nosferatu."
// SendOffString :
"P1123283836" "I'll do that. Riptide has told me that Nosferatu and his minions have cleared the town of the Fir Bolg and the witches. They truly are intending a full take over of the city.<br><br>Riptide won't be able to hold off against Nosferatu for very long, but he's left beacons behind that you can activate to provide him some support.<br><br><color orange>Nosferatu is very powerful, {HeroName}, you'd best be careful. Aurora is on her way to give you support, and Riptide will also be able to help you if you can keep him from being defeated beforehand.</color>"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2419318310" "Stop Nosferatu's attack on Croatoa"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2094469344" "Nosferatu is extremely powerful. Be on your guard, {HeroName}."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P484685166" "<color deepskyblue>Part Two: Nosferatu's Croatoa</color>"

