"P551730851" "Marauder"
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// - ScriptDef - LuaMission 
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable Caption :
"P1557699103" "<t=5 caption x=0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor Black>'You hear Calvin Scott speak on the speakers throughout the base...'<t=5 caption x=0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor Black>You really are something. Why must you oppose this change?<t=5 caption x=0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor Black>Our armies are ready, we have all the chips in our corner. We're going to make things BETTER!<t=5 caption x=0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor Black>Blood must be spilled in Primal Earth to save it from tyranny. Yet, you would stop that.<t=5 caption x=0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor Black>This will be your funeral. Launch the - what are you - *CHHHHHHH*."
// Script Variable Caption :
"P361125378" "<t=7 caption x=0.3 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color Black><bgcolor GoldenRod>Marchand reporting. Marauder has appeared, I'm sending you his location."
