"P3298811894" "They think they can defeat us! How laughable!"
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// - ScriptDef - LuaEncounter 
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable ALLY_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P1601065284" "Hrmph... they know what they're doing..."
