// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable Caption :
"P449959194" "<t=8 caption x=0.3 y=0.3 d=8><scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor Black>So, it's come to this. I should've known Marauder would betray us all. He was never one for our vision of freedom.<t=8 caption x=0.3 y=0.3 d=8><scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor Black>The New Praetorians won't be able to destroy the Council's forces. There are too many of them.<t=8 caption x=0.3 y=0.3 d=8><scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor Black>You'd have to release all the lava in the volcano to destroy the Nictus and the War Walkers.<t=3 caption x=0.3 y=0.3 d=3><scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor Black>If you continue to fight-.<t=8 caption x=0.7 y=0.3 d=8><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor MediumPurple>Calvin, STOP! Come to your senses! This is not going to end well for you!<t=8 caption x=0.3 y=0.3 d=8><scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor Black>Aurora! ... No, you're wrong. Tell me! What is it you're not seeing?!<t=8 caption x=0.7 y=0.3 d=8><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor MediumPurple>You need help, Calvin, you always needed help. We can help you, just please stop all of this!<t=8 caption x=0.3 y=0.3 d=8><scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor Black>I'm doing all this to save the people, to save YOU! What don't you understand?!<t=8 caption x=0.7 y=0.3 d=8><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor MediumPurple>... I'm sorry, Calvin, for what is going to happen to you next."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
