// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P4014195017" "I had a VISION, {HeroName}. A vision of a better world, a world of peace!"
// Script Variable BOSS_90HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1469460101" "This world is doomed! Don't you see?! The persecutions! The prejudices!"
// Script Variable BOSS_80HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2862327801" "Look at what is attacked every day! What is kept hidden from you! Is it right?! Is it FAIR?!"
// Script Variable BOSS_70HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P720461974" "Is it FAIR that a man like me is cast as a villain? As a lunatic? For all THAT I'VE DONE?!"
// Script Variable BOSS_60HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1509027595" "You've become... too complacent... things can change... it just takes force... of will... and of might...!"
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1400105579" "No more... Talking... I won't lose... not to the likes... of you...!"
// Script Variable BOSS_20HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1788236071" "No... no I cannot lose...!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P848395659" "Proximity Mine"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// CutScene 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// 5 Actor2 :
"P1610755509" "<t=5 d=5 em CatchBreath>Ah... hah... I shouldn't have... tried to go... toe to toe... with you... {HeroName}..."
// 5 Caption :
"P4143138140" "<x=0.3 y=0.3 t=6 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor MediumPurple>Calvin, that's ENOUGH!"
// 2 Actor2 :
"P1198338154" "<t=2 d=2>Why...? I'm fighting for our-"
// 5 Caption :
"P2958976675" "<x=0.5 y=0.2 t=5 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor MediumPurple>SHUT UP! Look at yourself! Look at REALITY!"
// 5 Caption :
"P4122514960" "<x=0.5 y=0.2 t=5 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor MediumPurple>You're allies with -vampires-, -werewolves-, and -space aliens-!"
// 5 Caption :
"P171732133" "<x=0.5 y=0.2 t=5 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor MediumPurple>In Praetoria, you forced Clockwork to attack innocent civilians! You killed them in cold blood!"
// 5 Caption :
"P889701962" "<x=0.5 y=0.2 t=5 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor MediumPurple>And you tried to blow up a hospital! You're as much of a monster as Cole!"
// 5 Caption :
"P2835544579" "<x=0.5 y=0.2 t=5 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor MediumPurple>You stopped caring about freedom a long time ago, Calvin!"
// 0 Caption :
"P442230363" "<x=0.5 y=0.2 t=5 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor MediumPurple>All you cared about was being RIGHT! And now, you - what are you doing?"
// 5 Actor2 :
"P3946927868" "<goto Walk>"
// 8 Actor2 :
"P4069095301" "<t=8 d=8>... Vandal installed a self-destruct device here. It was done to destroy the New Praetorians if they succeeded."
// 6 Actor2 :
"P4236276364" "<t=6 d=6>... I'm going to stay behind to blow up this place. I'll get you and the others out of here."
// 7 Caption :
"P531801893" "<x=0.5 y=0.2 t=7 d=7><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor MediumPurple>Calvin... we can get you out of here too, suicide isn't the answer!"
// 5 Actor2 :
"P2839999263" "<t=5 d=5>This is my justice, Aurora. And you, {HeroName}..."
// 5 Caption :
"P2092917165" "<x=0.5 y=0.2 t=6 d=5><scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor Black>Don't become like me. Don't lose sight of what you're fighting for."
// 5 Actor2 :
"P2012040790" "<t=5 d=5>The world will know in his last act, Calvin Scott did something good."

